## 2. CODE-INDEX MCP Server

### Purpose
Full-text search across codebase with symbol and reference indexing for rapid code exploration

### Core Functionality
- Full-text search with syntax highlighting
- Symbol indexing (functions, classes, variables)
- Cross-reference tracking
- Semantic code search
- Usage pattern analysis

### API Design

#### Tools Available:
```typescript
interface CodeIndexTools {
  // Indexing Operations
  buildIndex(repoPath: string): IndexBuildResult;
  updateIndex(repoPath: string, changedFiles: string[]): IndexUpdateResult;
  getIndexStats(repoPath: string): IndexStatistics;
  
  // Search Operations
  searchText(query: string, options?: SearchOptions): SearchResult[];
  searchSymbols(symbolName: string, type?: SymbolType): SymbolResult[];
  findReferences(symbol: string, filePath: string): ReferenceResult[];
  
  // Code Analysis
  getSymbolDefinitions(filePath: string): SymbolDefinition[];
  findUsages(symbol: string): UsageLocation[];
  analyzeImports(filePath: string): ImportAnalysis;
}
```

#### Data Structures:
```typescript
interface SearchOptions {
  fileTypes?: string[];
  caseSensitive?: boolean;
  regex?: boolean;
  maxResults?: number;
  context?: number; // lines of context
}

interface SearchResult {
  filePath: string;
  lineNumber: number;
  columnNumber: number;
  matchText: string;
  context: string[];
  score: number;
}

interface SymbolDefinition {
  name: string;
  type: SymbolType;
  filePath: string;
  location: Location;
  signature?: string;
  documentation?: string;
}

enum SymbolType {
  FUNCTION = 'function',
  CLASS = 'class',
  VARIABLE = 'variable',
  INTERFACE = 'interface',
  MODULE = 'module'
}
```

